[I] A simple and easy-to-use library to enjoy videogames programming

[T] Raylib is highly inspired by Borland BGI graphics lib and by XNA
[T] framework and it's especially well suited for prototyping, tooling,
[T] graphical applications, embedded systems and education.

[U] https://www.raylib.com

